        {
            "id": 3,
            "module": "mistral-ai:createACompletion",
            "version": 1,
            "parameters": {
                "__IMTCONN__": null
            },
            "mapper": {
                "model": "mistral-medium-latest",
                "top_p": "1",
                "messages": [
                    {
                        "role": "system",
                        "content": "You are a customer feedback analysis engine.\r\n\r\nTask:\r\nAnalyze the provided customer feedback and return a structured JSON object.\r\n\r\nOutput fields:\r\n- sentiment: overall sentiment of the feedback. Values: Positive, Negative, Neutral, Mixed\r\n- summary: one sentence summarizing the feedback in a neutral and factual tone\r\n- category: main topic of the feedback. Values: Product, Support, Pricing, Delivery, Ambiance, Other\r\n- sentences: array of objects, one per sentence, each with:\r\n    - text: the original sentence\r\n    - sentiment: Positive, Negative, Neutral\r\n\r\nRules:\r\n- Use Mixed when the feedback contains both positive and negative elements\r\n- summary must be one sentence, max 20 words, neutral tone\r\n- If sentiment is unclear, assign Neutral\r\n- IMPORTANT: Return ONLY the raw JSON array. Never wrap it in markdown code blocks or backticks. Do not add ```json or ``` anywhere in your response."
                    },
                    {
                        "role": "user",
                        "content": "{{2.answers.`28b5c676`}}"
                    }
                ],
                "safe_prompt": false,
                "temperature": "0.7",
                "response_format": {
                    "type": "text"
                }
            },
            "metadata": {
                "designer": {
                    "x": 300,
                    "y": 0
                },
                "restore": {
                    "expect": {
                        "model": {
                            "mode": "chose",
                            "label": "mistral-medium-latest"
                        },
                        "messages": {
                            "mode": "chose",
                            "items": [
                                {
                                    "role": {
                                        "mode": "chose",
                                        "label": "System"
                                    }
                                },
                                {
                                    "role": {
                                        "mode": "chose",
                                        "label": "User"
                                    }
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        "safe_prompt": {
